    "payload": {
      "content": {
        "to": "mrzadexinho@gmail.com",
        "body": "Hi there —\n\nI’m reaching out because we’ve been working with teams that are hiring and trying to scale outbound without adding a lot of manual busywork.\n\nWe built GTM tooling that helps reps (and founders) quickly:\n- research accounts/roles and draft personalized outreach,\n- automate follow-ups with guardrails,\n- track what’s working across sequences,\n- keep messaging consistent while still sounding human.\n\nIf you’re open to it, I’d love to learn how you’re running outbound today and share a 10–15 minute walkthrough to see if it could help your team.\n\nWould next week work for a quick chat? If you tell me what you’re hiring for and your ICP, I can tailor examples.\n\nBest,\n[Your Name]\n[Title / Company]\n[Phone / Calendly]",
